{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2022-12", "window": 2, "start_date": 1670457600, "end_date": 1671148799, "month_true_total": 212, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:02:35 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "128604999", "author": {"steamid": "76561198847053801", "personaname": "Purpleetea", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198847053801/", "num_games_owned": 712, "num_reviews": 456, "playtime_forever": 677, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 677, "last_played": 1671110907, "avatar": "d4b8501b3095d0baad35a42b9279c495d9f6f39c"}, "language": "english", "review": "You’re but a human only. . . What, who said that? Let me smack them into reality.\nNo time to cry over spilled milk…the future is grim and dark. Time to suit you up for huge battle cause war..war will never end. Critilcal mission retrieve and save Titan. Failure unacceptable. Your death is absolete-serve the emperor. We will destroy Nemeroth with a skill and steel, or die trying. \nUltra marines shield up with most advanced weaponry. You are the chosen Death Angel that purges chaos in daily basis. Orcs are only appetizers. \nThis is definition about one of the most bad ass Warhammer game ever created: until Space Marine 2 will come out to. The game oozes with share spear of light and brutality. Every encounter feels like you god like. There are no little moments. The game don’t have time for little moments. Only huge spectacle of battles between death and life. Each weapon you use serves you in emperors will.  But there is a moment when you pick up big freaking Astartes Thunder Hammer and every enemy will start to see fear. The moment I will never forget. Deus vult", "timestamp_created": 1671113103, "timestamp_updated": 1671113103, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.596234798431396484", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "